<h2 id="_3">四、生产部署配置</h2>
<h3 id="41-vllm-eagle-3">4.1 vLLM + EAGLE-3（推荐通用配置）</h3>
<pre><code class="language-bash">vllm serve meta-llama/Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct \
  --quantization fp8 \
  --speculative-model yuhuili/EAGLE3-LLaMA3.3-Instruct-70B \
  --num-speculative-tokens 6 \
  --speculative-draft-tensor-parallel-size 1 \
  --max-model-len 8192 \
  --gpu-memory-utilization 0.94 \
  --max-num-seqs 32
</code></pre>
<h3 id="42-vllm-arctic-inferenceagent">4.2 vLLM + Arctic Inference（Agent 代码场景推荐）</h3>
<pre><code class="language-bash">vllm serve meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct \
  --quantization fp8 \
  --tensor-parallel-size 2 \
  --speculative-config '{
    &quot;method&quot;: &quot;arctic&quot;,
    &quot;model&quot;: &quot;Snowflake/Arctic-LSTM-Speculator-Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct&quot;,
    &quot;num_speculative_tokens&quot;: 3,
    &quot;enable_suffix_decoding&quot;: true
  }'
</code></pre>
